# This is the processing directive for bitemporal Anchor Modeling in SQL Server
#
# The templates are in the Sisula language (docs/SISULA.md) and render the JSON bindings that the
# modeler builds (Generate > JSON bindings). The scripts first in the list prepare the schema that the
# bindings are made from; they run once, before the templates. A line starting with # is not run.
# The original sisulets, which these replace, are listed in SQLServer_bi.legacy.directive.
SQL/Helpers.js
SQL/NamingConvention.js
SQL/SQLServer/NamingConvention.js
SQL/SQLServer/derive.js
SQL/SQLServer/clr/Anchor.sisula
SQL/SQLServer/bi/CreateKnots.sisula
SQL/SQLServer/bi/CreateAnchors.sisula
SQL/SQLServer/bi/CreateNexuses.sisula
SQL/SQLServer/bi/CreateAttributes.sisula
SQL/SQLServer/bi/CreateAttributeAssembledViews.sisula
SQL/SQLServer/bi/CreateAttributeRewinders.sisula
SQL/SQLServer/bi/AddAttributeRestatementConstraints.sisula
SQL/SQLServer/biz/DropAnchorBusinessPerspectives.sisula
SQL/SQLServer/bi/CreateAnchorPerspectives.sisula
SQL/SQLServer/biz/CreateAnchorBusinessPerspectives.sisula
SQL/SQLServer/biz/DropNexusBusinessPerspectives.sisula
SQL/SQLServer/bi/CreateNexusPerspectives.sisula
SQL/SQLServer/biz/CreateNexusBusinessPerspectives.sisula
SQL/SQLServer/bi/CreateKeyGenerators.sisula
SQL/SQLServer/bi/CreateAttributeTriggers.sisula
SQL/SQLServer/bi/CreateAnchorTriggers.sisula
SQL/SQLServer/bi/CreateNexusTriggers.sisula
SQL/SQLServer/bi/CreateTies.sisula
SQL/SQLServer/bi/CreateTieAssembledViews.sisula
SQL/SQLServer/bi/AddTieRestatementConstraints.sisula
SQL/SQLServer/bi/CreateTieRewinders.sisula
SQL/SQLServer/biz/DropTieBusinessPerspectives.sisula
SQL/SQLServer/bi/CreateTiePerspectives.sisula
SQL/SQLServer/biz/CreateTieBusinessPerspectives.sisula
SQL/SQLServer/bi/CreateTieTriggers.sisula
SQL/SQLServer/CreateSchemaTracking.sisula
SQL/SQLServer/bi/AddDescriptions.sisula
